lines = PackedStringArray("The stars were wrong last night. Slightly wrong.", "Where did I put that newt?", "Hm. The cauldron is singing again.", "Seven hundred years of study, and still the kettle boils over.", "Visitors. How... unusual.", "Mind the runes. They bite.")
